        "name": "Réponse CF / Bureau"
      },
      "value": "<div><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:6pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Le tableau</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">1 indique le nombre de mineurs bénéficiant d’une allocation pour impotent, classés en fonction de leur degré d’impotence (faible, moyen ou grave) et de leur éventuel droit à un supplément pour soins intenses (SSI). Au total, 12</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">414 enfants et adolescents ont touché une allocation pour impotent en</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2022. Près de 3000</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">d’entre eux ont également bénéficié d’un SSI</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">; ce supplément est octroyé lorsque le traitement et les soins de base nécessaires requièrent en moyenne quatre heures de plus par jour que pour un mineur du même âge en bonne santé. Les données sont classées par tranche d’âge</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">; en effet, le nombre de cas pour chaque âge spécifique étant très faible, il ne peut pas être précisé pour des raisons de protection des données.</span></p><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"-aw-border-insideh:0.5pt single #000000; -aw-border-insidev:0.5pt single #000000; border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"width:186.9pt; border-style:solid double solid solid; border-width:0.75pt 1.5pt 0.75pt 0.75pt; padding-right:4.65pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#eaf1dd; -aw-border-bottom:0.5pt single; -aw-border-left:0.5pt single; -aw-border-top:0.5pt single\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">Allocation pour impotent</span></p></td><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"width:182.4pt; border-style:solid solid solid double; border-width:0.75pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 1.5pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:4.65pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#e5dfec; -aw-border-bottom:0.5pt single; -aw-border-right:0.5pt single; -aw-border-top:0.5pt single\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">Supplément pour soins intenses</span></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; vertical-align:top; -aw-border-bottom:0.5pt single\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:38.6pt; border-style:solid; border-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#d9d9d9; -aw-border:0.5pt single\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">Âge</span></p></td><td style=\"width:38.65pt; border-style:solid; border-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#d9d9d9; -aw-border:0.5pt single\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">Impotence faible</span></p></td><td style=\"width:38.6pt; border-style:solid; border-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#d9d9d9; -aw-border:0.5pt single\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">Impotence moyenne</span></p></td><td style=\"width:38.65pt; border-style:solid double solid solid; border-width:0.75pt 1.5pt 0.75pt 0.75pt; padding-right:4.65pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#d9d9d9; -aw-border-bottom:0.5pt single; -aw-border-left:0.5pt single; -aw-border-top:0.5pt single\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">Impotence grave</span></p></td><td style=\"width:30pt; border-style:solid solid solid double; border-width:0.75pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 1.5pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:4.65pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#d9d9d9; -aw-border-bottom:0.5pt single; -aw-border-right:0.5pt single; -aw-border-top:0.5pt single\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">Pas de SSI</span></p></td><td style=\"width:40pt; border-style:solid; border-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#d9d9d9; -aw-border:0.5pt single\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">SSI – 4</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">heures</span></p></td><td style=\"width:40pt; border-style:solid; border-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#d9d9d9; -aw-border:0.5pt single\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">SSI – 6</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold\">heures</span></p></td><td style=\"width:40pt; border-style:solid double solid solid; border-width:0.75pt 1.5pt 0.75pt 0.75pt; padding-right:4.65pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#d9d9d9; -aw-border-bottom:0.5pt single